\item What is compared and how the runs are made go to \code{\link[=dossier]{dossier()}}:
\code{run_dossier(dossier("mypkg", base = cran_version("1.2.0"), reps = 0))}.
\item How the runs go stays here: \code{run_dossier(step_timeout = 900, workers = 2)}.
\item The comparison's tolerances go to \code{\link[=compare_runs]{compare_runs()}} through \code{...}:
\code{run_dossier(tol = 1e-3)}.
