Before upgrading a package you use, see what would change for you:
\code{run_dossier(dossier("ggplot2", base = installed_version(), candidate = cran_release()))}.

A quick look, without timings to label: \code{run_dossier(dossier("mypkg", reps = 0), workers = 2)}. To keep the work between R sessions, give the dossier a work
